D3DXVECTOR3 ioBaseChar::GetEnableWarpPosition( ioBaseChar *pChar, int iAngleCnt, float fRange, float fMaxRange, bool bCheckDropZone,
											   bool bCheckHeight, float fLimitHeight, bool bSkillPos, int iStartingPoint )
{
	D3DXVECTOR3 vNewPos = ioMath::VEC3_ZERO;
	if ( bSkillPos && m_CharState == CS_USING_SKILL )
	{
		ioTeleportAttackSkill2 *pTeleportAttackSkill2 = ToTeleportAttackSkill2( m_pActiveSkill );
		if ( pTeleportAttackSkill2 )
			vNewPos = pTeleportAttackSkill2->GetStartPos();
		else 
			vNewPos = GetWorldPosition();
	}
	else if( iStartingPoint == ioWarpStateBuff::PT_STARTING_POINT )
	{
		vNewPos = m_pModeParent->GetStartPos( GetTeam() );
	}
	else if( iStartingPoint == ioWarpStateBuff::PT_ENEMY_STARTING_POINT )
	{
		TeamType eTeamType = GetTeam();
		if( eTeamType == TEAM_RED )
			eTeamType = TEAM_BLUE;
		else if( eTeamType == TEAM_BLUE )
			eTeamType = TEAM_RED;

		vNewPos = m_pModeParent->GetStartPos( eTeamType );
	}
	else
		vNewPos = GetWorldPosition();

	if( !pChar )
		return vNewPos;

	if( iAngleCnt == 0 ) 
		return vNewPos;

	if( fRange == 0.0f )
		return vNewPos;

	float fAngle = 360.0f / (float)iAngleCnt;
	D3DXVECTOR3 vDir = GetTargetRot() * D3DXVECTOR3( 0.0f, 0.0f, -FLOAT1 );

	typedef std::vector<D3DXVECTOR3> vPosList;
	vPosList vPointList;

	IORandom eRandom;
	DWORD dwSeed = pChar->GetRandomSeed();

	float fCurMax = max( fRange, fMaxRange );
	float fGapRange = fabsf( fRange - fCurMax );

	for( int i=0; i < iAngleCnt; ++i )
	{
		D3DXQUATERNION qtRot;
		D3DXVECTOR3 vCurPos, vCurDir;

		float fCurAngle = fAngle * i;

		D3DXQuaternionRotationAxis( &qtRot, &ioMath::UNIT_Y, DEGtoRAD(fCurAngle) );
		vCurDir = qtRot * vDir;
		
		float fCurRange = fRange;
		if( fRange != fCurMax )
		{
			eRandom.SetRandomSeed( dwSeed + i );
			int iRand = eRandom.Random( (DWORD)fGapRange );
			fCurRange = fRange + iRand;
		}

		vCurPos = vNewPos + ( fCurRange * vCurDir );

		float fMapHeight = m_pCreator->GetMapHeightNoneEntity( vCurPos.x, vCurPos.z, vCurPos.y+3.0f );
		if( bCheckDropZone && fMapHeight <= 0.0f )
			continue;

		if( bCheckHeight )
		{
			float fNewMapHeight = m_pCreator->GetMapHeight( vCurPos.x, vCurPos.z );
			float fNewGap = fabsf(fNewMapHeight - vCurPos.y);
			if( fNewGap <= fLimitHeight )
				vCurPos.y = fNewMapHeight;
			else
				continue;
		}

		vPointList.push_back( vCurPos );
	}

	int iPointSize = vPointList.size();
	if( iPointSize == 0 )
		return pChar->GetWorldPosition();

	eRandom.SetRandomSeed( dwSeed );

	int iRandom = eRandom.Random( iPointSize );
	if( COMPARE( iRandom, 0, iPointSize ) )
	{
		vNewPos = vPointList[iRandom];
	}

	return vNewPos;
}

D3DXVECTOR3 ioBaseChar::GetEnableTeleportPosition( const D3DXVECTOR3& vMainPos,
												   ioBaseChar *pChar,
												   int iAngleCnt,
												   float fRange,
												   float fGapHeight )
{
	D3DXVECTOR3 vNewPos = ioMath::VEC3_ZERO;
	vNewPos = vMainPos;

	if( !pChar )
		return vNewPos;

	if( iAngleCnt == 0 ) 
		return vNewPos;

	if( fRange == 0.0f )
		return vNewPos;

	float fAngle = 360.0f / (float)iAngleCnt;
	D3DXVECTOR3 vDir = GetTargetRot() * D3DXVECTOR3( 0.0f, 0.0f, -FLOAT1 );

	typedef std::vector<D3DXVECTOR3> vPosList;

	vPosList vPointList;
	for( int i=0; i < iAngleCnt; ++i )
	{
		D3DXQUATERNION qtRot;
		D3DXVECTOR3 vCurPos, vCurDir;

		float fCurAngle = fAngle * i;

		D3DXQuaternionRotationAxis( &qtRot, &ioMath::UNIT_Y, DEGtoRAD(fCurAngle) );
		vCurDir = qtRot * vDir;
		vCurPos = vNewPos + ( fRange * vCurDir );

		float fMapHeight = m_pCreator->GetMapHeight( vCurPos.x, vCurPos.z, NULL );
		float fGap = fabs( vCurPos.y - fMapHeight );
		if( fMapHeight <= 0.0f || fGap > fGapHeight )
			continue;

		vPointList.push_back( vCurPos );
	}

	int iPointSize = vPointList.size();
	if( iPointSize == 0 )
	{
		return vMainPos;
	}

	IORandom eRandom;
	DWORD dwSeed = pChar->GetRandomSeed();
	eRandom.SetRandomSeed( dwSeed );

	int iRandom = eRandom.Random( iPointSize );
	if( COMPARE( iRandom, 0, iPointSize ) )
	{
		vNewPos = vPointList[iRandom];
	}

	return vNewPos;
}

